  "body": "Secure the final available residence in this exclusive collection of luxury freehold homes, perfectly positioned in one of Takapuna’s most sought-after locations. Just moments from the beach, vibrant cafés and shopping, this exceptional home is also zoned for some of Auckland’s most prestigious schools, delivering an outstanding lifestyle for families and professionals alike.\r\n\r\nDesigned with uncompromising attention to detail, this freestanding residence offers four generous bedrooms, each with its own private ensuite, complemented by a lift servicing every level for effortless everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe designer kitchen is crafted for both entertaining and family life, featuring premium Miele appliances, induction and gas cooking, and beautifully appointed finishes throughout. A fully enclosed balcony captures elevated water views, creating the perfect space to relax in every season.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n\r\n• Final residence available\r\n• Freestanding home on a freehold title\r\n• Four spacious bedrooms, each with its own ensuite\r\n• Internal lift\r\n• Designer kitchen with premium Miele appliances\r\n• Induction and gas cooking\r\n• Fully enclosed balcony with water views\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n• Walk to Takapuna Beach, cafés, restaurants and shopping\r\n• Zoned for Takapuna’s highly regarded schools\r\n\r\nThe vendor is highly motivated and ready to meet the market. This presents a rare opportunity to secure an exceptional luxury home in one of Auckland’s premier coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nLuxury. Location. Lifestyle. The final opportunity is here.",
